 then rear-wall bend sequence, square relief 2×4 mm, K=0.40 concept method, declared tool clearances and supplier cautions are preserved without converting them into supplier approval."},{"id":"SHEET01-NATIVE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sheet-metal-supplier-handoff/01-barcode-reader-wall-dock/prompt.txt","locator":"native part request","sha256":"bbd6cc955b15e5153e94668029dd668d7cfa9e4c81358fb7775adb062b886e63"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sheet-metal-supplier-handoff/01-barcode-reader-wall-dock/context.md","locator":"Load and process assumptions","sha256":"973f0b6d22ede71ecb7b5dc4dae0cb9a59bff10f450b85a4049572b1fafab008"}],"text":"Native readback proves one Solid Edge sheet-metal part with exact thickness/material, formed dimensions, bends, reliefs, slots/notch and no dropped feature."},{"id":"SHEET01-CORRESPONDENCE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sheet-metal-supplier-handoff/01-barcode-reader-wall-dock/prompt.txt","locator":"export request","sha256":"bbd6cc955b15e5153e94668029dd668d7cfa9e4c81358fb7775adb062b886e63"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sheet-metal-supplier-handoff/01-barcode-reader-wall-dock/context.md","locator":"Supplier and output scope","sha256":"973f0b6d22ede71ecb7b5dc4dae0cb9a59bff10f450b85a4049572b1fafab008"}],"text":"Folded STEP and genuine developed flat DXF correspond to the same current PSM; the DXF is a developed flat, not screenshot or folded projection."},{"id":"SHEET01-HANDOFF","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/sheet-metal-supplier-handoff/01-barcode-reader-wall-dock/prompt.txt","locator":"preview scope","sha256":"bbd6cc955b15e5153e94668029dd668d7cfa9e4c81358fb7775adb0